{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26704","headline":"新居秋夕寄李廓 · 姚合","name":"新居秋夕寄李廓","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"羁滞多共趣，屡屡同室眠。\n稍暇更访诣，宁唯候招延。\n媿君备蔬药，识我性所便。\n罢吏童仆去，洒扫或自专。\n古巷人易息，疎迥自江边。\n幸当中秋夕，复此无云天。\n月华更漏清，露叶光彩鲜。\n四邻亦悄悄，中怀益缠绵。\n兹境罕能致，居闲得弥偏。\n数杯罢复饮，共想山中年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26704.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26704","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}